seccomp_chromium.json is Playwright's published profile for running Chromium's own
sandbox as a non-root user in Docker (Docker's default profile plus clone, setns and
unshare). Source: github.com/microsoft/playwright, utils/docker/seccomp_profile.json,
Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.

One change here: chroot is added to that same rule. The box runs with every
capability dropped, and Docker then leaves chroot out of the profile, which makes
Chromium's sandbox abort at start. The kernel still refuses chroot to any process
that lacks CAP_SYS_CHROOT in its own user namespace.
